      "en": "and I will cut off the judge from among them, and will kill all its princes with him,” says the LORD.",
      "ko": "내가 그 중에서 재판장을 멸하며 방백들을 저와 함께 죽이리라 이는 여호와의 말씀이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "18f9486ae80961b34ee1f006baf6e17483ef9ae2f8f3eb7f2d263e9302b41496",
      "translation_text_hash": "c3bb26185b20660af8172cd5580a79fd1ec40e683bf0e743fdbcdceb73961118",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
