      "en": "but I will send a fire on Judah, and it will devour the palaces of Jerusalem.”",
      "ko": "내가 유다에 불을 보내리니 예루살렘의 궁궐들을 사르리라",
      "source_text_hash": "0e37d70033eccfe80a0570bc93844d6de3f95f627c050d6786a10a826a3f343a",
      "translation_text_hash": "ad8b2944739c79e760493daf2fd9c1d484b423d67806f1df0a052ee4d6f4cd9f",
